  ["Someone who prevents harm only by accident is considered morally good.", False, "정답 ▶ F\n이유: 의도치 않게 해를 막은 사람은 도덕적으로 선하지 않아요.\n어휘 ▶ by accident 우연히", 39, "is not morally good"],
  ["The writer agrees with Kant that results are unnecessary for moral goodness.", False, "정답 ▶ F\n이유: 칸트와 달리(contrary to Kant), 어느 정도 결과가 필요하다고 해요.", 39, "contrary to Kant, some results are necessary"],
