     ["Like a camera, the human mind records scenes without any bias.", "Our momentary priorities affect how we see a scene.", "People rarely imagine a hammer viewed from directly above.", "Cameras capture only shapes and colors.", "Photographs may surprise us because they present details without interpreting them."],
